# n-ary DisjointClasses -> all pairs Ci AND Cj subseteq bottom, i<j, canonical order.
# 3 classes must yield exactly 3 pairs, not 6 and not 1.

@prefix :    <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:C1 a owl:Class . :C2 a owl:Class . :C3 a owl:Class .
[] a owl:AllDisjointClasses ; owl:members ( :C1 :C2 :C3 ) .
